# Buttons

## Rules

- Reuse the existing `ClickableButton` component (exported from `components/ui/index.ts`) whenever a button is needed.
- Respect the style of the reference component.
- Buttons must follow the Design System for all visual properties, including
colors, typography, spacing, radius, sizing, states, and iconography.
- Use a clean, compact, content-driven appearance with clear visual hierarchy
between primary, secondary, and low-emphasis actions.

## Reference implementation
See `components/ui/button.tsx`.